# Shared build context hygiene for every apps/*/Dockerfile (context = repo
# root). Keeps `turbo prune` input small and never ships local state, secrets,
# or unrelated trees into the builder. Critically, generated/stale artifacts
# (tsbuildinfo, dist, generated clients) are excluded: turbo prune cannot use
# git to filter files (no .git in the context), so anything present would be
# copied verbatim and break in-image builds (e.g. a stale tsbuildinfo makes
# tsc skip emitting dist entirely).
.git
.github
.fallow
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/src/generated
out
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
artillery-report
reports
mutation
.stryker-tmp
docs
tests
bruno
infra
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.DS_Store
